msgid "Undo Journal"
msgstr "Jurnal Pembatalan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1275
msgid "Undo journal — capture before-state of every mutating tool call"
msgstr ""
"Jurnal pembatalan — tangkap kondisi-sebelum dari setiap panggilan alat yang "
"mengubah data"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1277
msgid ""
"Lets changes made through MCP be undone from the Activity tab. Disabling "
"stops new entries from being captured; existing history is kept until it "
"expires."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan perubahan yang dibuat melalui MCP dibatalkan dari tab "
"Aktivitas. Menonaktifkan akan menghentikan penangkapan entri baru; riwayat "
"yang ada disimpan hingga kedaluwarsa."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1281
msgid "Undo Retention"
msgstr "Retensi Pembatalan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1284
msgid "days to keep undo history"
msgstr "hari untuk menyimpan riwayat pembatalan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1288
msgid "Checkpoint Limit"
msgstr "Batas Checkpoint"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1291
msgid "checkpoints to keep"
msgstr "checkpoint yang disimpan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1295 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1305
msgid "Auto-Checkpoint"
msgstr "Checkpoint Otomatis"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1299
msgid "Auto-checkpoint before mutating WP-CLI commands"
msgstr "Checkpoint otomatis sebelum perintah WP-CLI yang mengubah data"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1301
msgid ""
"Takes a full-database checkpoint before running a WP-CLI command that is not "
"read-only, so it can be rolled back even if the command itself cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr ""
"Mengambil checkpoint seluruh database sebelum menjalankan perintah WP-CLI "
"yang tidak hanya-baca, sehingga dapat dikembalikan meskipun perintah itu "
"sendiri tidak dapat dibatalkan."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1309
msgid "Auto-checkpoint before plugin & theme updates"
msgstr "Checkpoint otomatis sebelum pembaruan plugin & tema"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1311
msgid ""
"Takes a full-database checkpoint before plugin or theme updates, so database "
"migrations run by an update can be rolled back. The old files are separately "
"backed up per update for undo."
msgstr ""
"Membuat checkpoint database lengkap sebelum pembaruan plugin atau tema, "
"sehingga migrasi database yang dijalankan oleh pembaruan dapat dibatalkan. "
"File lama juga dicadangkan secara terpisah pada setiap pembaruan untuk "
"pengurungan."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1319 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1323
msgid "Power Mode"
msgstr "Power Mode"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1319
msgid "advanced · off by default"
msgstr "lanjutan · nonaktif secara bawaan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1327
msgid "Lift safety restrictions for advanced operations"
msgstr "Cabut pembatasan keamanan untuk operasi lanjutan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1331
msgid ""
"<strong>Danger:</strong> allows <code>eval</code>/<code>shell</code>, "
"dangerous SQL, writing files anywhere, and requests to internal addresses. "
"This grants effective <strong>remote code execution</strong> to anyone "
"holding an API key. Only enable on a trusted, locked-down site you control. "
"Your MCP API keys and the plugin&#8217;s own settings stay protected."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Bahaya:</strong> mengizinkan <code>eval</code>/<code>shell</code>, "
"SQL berbahaya, penulisan file di mana saja, dan permintaan ke alamat "
"internal. Ini memberikan <strong>eksekusi kode jarak jauh</strong> yang "
"efektif kepada siapa pun yang memegang kunci API. Aktifkan hanya di situs "
"tepercaya dan terkunci yang Anda kendalikan. Kunci API MCP Anda dan "
"pengaturan plugin ini sendiri tetap terlindungi."

